---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog | Jay Vastani
description: Notes on product management, AI-first workflows, and trust & identity — lessons from 10+ years building products.
---
<section class="blog section" id="blog">
   <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section__title-1">
         <span>Blog</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="blog__intro">
         Notes on product management, AI-first workflows, trust &amp; identity, and what
         I've learned building things over the years.
      </p>

      {% set posts = collections.posts %}
      {% if posts.length %}
      <div class="blog__list">
         {% for post in posts %}
         <a class="blog__item" href="{{ post.url }}">
            <span class="blog__item-date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
            <h3 class="blog__item-title">{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
            {% if post.data.description %}
            <p class="blog__item-description">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
            {% endif %}
            <span class="blog__item-link">Read more <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></span>
         </a>
         {% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% else %}
      <p class="blog__empty">No posts yet — first one is coming soon.</p>
      {% endif %}
   </div>
</section>